# Copy to search.env here. compose.yaml reads it through `env_file` on the search role only, so no
# key ever reaches the container that reads caller-chosen pages. Gitignored, like .env.
#
# SEEKWRIGHT_<BACKEND>_API_KEY, the backend being the name before the first `:` (so `exa` and
# `exa:free` share SEEKWRIGHT_EXA_API_KEY). A key is spent only for a name enabled AND permitted in
# search.toml, and an enabled name with no key is startup-fatal. The shipped pair needs no key.
#SEEKWRIGHT_SERPER_API_KEY=
#SEEKWRIGHT_EXA_API_KEY=
#SEEKWRIGHT_LINKUP_API_KEY=
